  "description": "token = base64url(message_id) + \".\" + base64url(HMAC-SHA256(EMAIL_UNSUBSCRIBE_SECRET, message_id)), no padding. Constant-time compare. Tokens never expire, and old secrets stay valid for verification indefinitely after a rotation. A test-send token signs `test:{random}`: it verifies, shows the page and writes nothing. An invalid token writes nothing.",
